{"id":"4812","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4812_main_cirrus-spissatus-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密</span>卷云的一个例子 - 云下的悬挂突起是不经常看到的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状</span>附加特征。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙巴塞罗那Vallvidrera","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"06 June 2016 0000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.12","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.12"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5037_main_cirrus-spissatus-mamma_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这是一个非常厚实、密集和大块的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状</span><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>的一个突出例子。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云状顶部</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">冰晶条纹</span>、阴影（这是厚厚的密云的常见特征）以及附近的高空探测指示云在7000米处，这些特征确认了卷云的观测。</p>\n<p>后缘可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">冰晶尾迹</span>。卷云似乎是积雨云上部的残余部分；但是，该地区没有积雨云活动。还存在许多<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">小片的薄高积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Akihito Umehara","location":"日本青森机场","latitude":"纬度: 40° 44' 17'' N","longitude":"经度: 140° 41' 19'' E","date":"28 September 2012 0604 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.12","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.12"}]}]}